# ENGINE_6 -- Package

Command: `/package-task`. The only zip path.

```bash
python3 scripts/package_task.py --slug <slug> --with-oracle
python3 scripts/ledger.py add --slug <slug>
```

`package_task.py` re-runs structure, leak scan, **difficulty design**,
novelty, then (with `--with-oracle`) oracle/nop. It writes `zip/<slug>.zip`
only if they pass, then re-validates the archive.

Do not `zip -r`. Byte-identical resubmits are blocked.

